message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Privacy-Preserving Educational Telemetry: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the instrumentation and pseudonymisation layers
  of a modular telemetry architecture for educational web platforms operating
  in sensitive contexts. Separates transport from the pedagogical event
  catalogue, dispatches every event over two independent routes so that the
  participant identifier never reaches the analytics engine, and applies
  HMAC-SHA256 with a dedicated server-side key before storage.
